      </div>
      <div type="article">
        <ab><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/>lisater<lb/><lb/><lb/>traten<lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/>o<lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/>ner tn<lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/>en<lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/>=<lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/>-<lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/><lb/></ab>
        <pb facs="0006.xml"/>
        <figure type="table"/>
        <figure type="table"/>
        <pb facs="0007.xml"/>
        <milestone unit="page" n="19"/>
      </div>
      <div type="article">
        <ab><milestone unit="column" n="1"/><lb/>Neb a gar e Vam-Vro hag a zo diere<lb/>Pa zigoue d'han tremen e-biou da Vreizidi,<lb/>Dleche ato lemel e dog d'o saludi !»</ab>
        <ab type="head"><lb/>Pez a Lavare george Sand</ab>
        <p rend="styled"><lb/>D'am mignon, ar barz “BOD-LANN"</p>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Eur skrivagnerez c’hall goude bezan lennet</l>
          <l><lb/>Oberou Kermarker a chomas estonet</l>
          <l><lb/>Rak na ouie tam 'bed, emezi, oa en Breiz-</l>
          <l><lb/>Gwerziou ken ijinus, ken uhel ha ken reiz.</l>
          <l><lb/>Na ouie tam e oa Poblrust ar Vretoned</l>
          <l><lb/>Gouest da zevel barzonegou ken awennet.</l>
          <l><lb/>« Kinnig Nominoë » d'he zonj a oa kaëroc'h</l>
          <l><lb/>Mil gwech, vit an Iliad, daoust d’han da vout berroch.</l>
        </lg>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Dre-ze, leun he c'halon, a zoujans vit hon Gouenn</l>
          <l><lb/>Ha vit he lennegez, dre-oll hi lavare</l>
          <l><lb/>Ar geriou nerzus-man : «Neb a zoug eur bluen,</l>
        </lg>
        <p rend="styled"><lb/>мAТНALZ</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article">
        <figure type="decoration"/>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Me az kuita, koulmik</l>
          <l><lb/>Kastellin.</l>
        </lg>
        <ab><lb/>Per GUEDES.</ab>
      </div>
      <div type="article">
        <ab><lb/>Madoberezou pouezet<lb/>Dre 'r pec'hejou paëet<lb/>Setans ar varn vezo :<lb/>«Den mad, it d’an Nenvo ».<lb/>Neuze me dregerno<lb/>A-uz d’an traonieno<lb/>Du-hont en huelder<lb/>Bro dous an alc’houeder.<lb/>War bolz an oablsavet<lb/>Dreist heol, loar ha stered<lb/>Pell diouz safar kazus<lb/>An draonien glac’harus.<lb/>Gant enkrez, va dousik,</ab>
        <ab type="head"><lb/>War hent an Nenv<lb/></ab>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Hag eun ezen c’houekoc'h</l>
          <l><lb/>C’houezo n’ouffet skanvoc'h</l>
          <l><lb/>Vit m'hellin tarnijal</l>
          <l><lb/>Euz eur bed d’eur bed-all.</l>
        </lg>
        <list>
          <item>Kenavo me laro</item>
        </list>
        <list>
          <item>D'id Breiz, o va mam-bro!</item>
        </list>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Kousk 'barz da c’houriz-vor,</l>
          <l><lb/>Da Bobl zo er goudor.</l>
        </lg>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Kousket, tud va c’herik</l>
          <l><lb/>Dindan an derwenik,</l>
          <l><lb/>Evidoc'h lintro c’hoaz</l>
          <l><lb/>Ar stered en oabl glaz.</l>
        </lg>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Kenavo mignoned,</l>
          <l><lb/>Parkeier ha loëned,</l>
          <l><lb/>Prajeier marellet</l>
          <l><lb/>Ha lannou alaouret.</l>
        </lg>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Ha da bokou ken flour</l>
          <l><lb/>Presuizoc'h evid aour.</l>
        </lg>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Dishuel, digabestr,</l>
          <l><lb/>Skanv — skany evel d'eul lestr</l>
          <l><lb/>Va ene gerzo sur</l>
          <l><lb/>Distag euz korf hudur.</l>
          <l><lb/>Beteg dor an Nenvou</l>
          <l><lb/>En tu-all d'an oablou,</l>
          <l><lb/>Ha setu me en Nenv</l>
          <l><lb/>Biskoaz teneroc’h lenv</l>
          <l><lb/>Biskoas sederoc kan</l>
          <l><lb/>Chalmaz va c'halon gwan</l>
          <l><lb/>Den n’euz morse gwelet.</l>
          <l><lb/>Traou ken kaër war ar bed</l>
          <l><lb/>Den na c’helche sonjal</l>
          <l><lb/>'N eul liorz ken brao all</l>
          <l><lb/>Ha Dreinded ha Gwerc'hez</l>
          <l><lb/>Frealz dre o c'haërder</l>
          <l><lb/>Eneou ken seder.</l>
          <l><lb/>Na 'vit aour na perlez</l>
          <l><lb/>Rachen eur seurt palez,</l>
          <l><lb/>Ra vezo va gwir Vro</l>
          <l><lb/>A-hed ar c'hantvejo.</l>
        </lg>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Kenavo trubuilliou,</l>
          <l><lb/>Krisder ha gwalleuriou,</l>
          <l><lb/>C'houi eo ho peuz prenet</l>
          <l><lb/>Vidon ar joausted.</l>
        </lg>
        <list>
          <item>Eno kavin Sant Per:</item>
        </list>
        <list>
          <item>« Deut en Nenv, mignon ker ».</item>
        </list>
        <list>
          <item>Eno Sent hag Elez</item>
        </list>
        <pb facs="0008.xml"/>
        <milestone unit="page" n="20"/>
        <ab><milestone unit="column" n="1"/><lb/><lb/>Ar Bleiner : Fanch Jaffrennou.<lb/></ab>
      </div>
      <div type="article">
        <ab><lb/>Roz-Kornaou, Poullaouën.</ab>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>O Breiz-Vihan, o kaëran-bro!</l>
          <l><lb/>Vdarre, ez-out adbevet,</l>
          <l><lb/>Bennoz d’an dud az kar ato :</l>
          <l><lb/>Da gevredigez ar Varzed.</l>
        </lg>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>D'ar wir vugals, gant enor,</l>
          <l><lb/>Zo savet, dre ar garante</l>
          <l><lb/>Evit an Douar hag ar Mor,</l>
          <l><lb/>Ha karante 'n eil d’egile.</l>
        </lg>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Ennout, va broik magerez,</l>
          <l><lb/>Demdost d’hon meneziou gwechall,</l>
          <l><lb/>El lec’h ma vevan dienkrez</l>
          <l><lb/>O klevet an dour o krozal.</l>
        </lg>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Merc’hed iaouank karantezuz,</l>
          <l><lb/>Zo skignet ennout hep niver</l>
          <l><lb/>Dudiuz int d’eun den pobluz,</l>
          <l><lb/>Ma kar ar gwiskamanchou kaër.</l>
        </lg>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Al lapous a gan hep ec’han,</l>
          <l><lb/>Barz an oabl, uz d’az lanneier.</l>
          <l><lb/>Bro-Vreiz a galon a garan,</l>
          <l><lb/>Hag ive he merc’hed tener.</l>
        </lg>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Unan anê, war dro d'am oad;</l>
          <l><lb/>'N he c’herc’hen eur groaz arc’hantet.</l>
          <l><lb/>Par d’ezhi ne oa ket, zur mad,</l>
          <l><lb/>Gant he c’hoeffik dantelezet.</l>
        </lg>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>laouank drant ha joaüz bepred</l>
          <l><lb/>E oan evithi, ar bed holl !...</l>
          <l><lb/>O! nag ar ieot zo alaouret,</l>
          <l><lb/>Dindan ar gwez doun en disheol.</l>
        </lg>
        <ab type="head"><lb/>Kenavo Karante!</ab>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Hi em rente gë, hirvidik,</l>
          <l><lb/>Va labour skanv, tro pad an de ;</l>
          <l><lb/>Ha pa lavare : Iwanik</l>
          <l><lb/>Ma c'halon dride, Va Doue!</l>
        </lg>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>A dreuz d'am hunvreou ive,</l>
          <l><lb/>A glevan he c’homzou ken mad</l>
          <l><lb/>H ma zal a sklerijenne,</l>
          <l><lb/>Gant an tan ouz he daoulagad.</l>
        </lg>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>O! pa hi gweliz da genta;</l>
          <l><lb/>Ha pa deuaz em flaneden</l>
          <l><lb/>Hi edo neuze ma c’haëra</l>
          <l><lb/>Ha va skeduza stereden.</l>
        </lg>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Pa bare al loar, splan ha skler</l>
          <l><lb/>En nenvou, er miziou brao ma,</l>
          <l><lb/>Ni, a rede, hon daou seder</l>
          <l><lb/>Ni a gerze 'n em vouz Kana.</l>
        </lg>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Hag etrezek ar sklerijen</l>
          <l><lb/>A skede barz ti he c’herent</l>
          <l><lb/>Ni zistroe dre ar blenen,</l>
          <l><lb/>Neur dremen dre gornik an hent.</l>
        </lg>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Hag entanet, ni retorne,</l>
          <l><lb/>'N eur gonta deuz brazder ar mestr.</l>
          <l><lb/>Me meuz renet an ene-ze,</l>
          <l><lb/>Giz d’eun heiez gant eur c’habestr.</l>
        </lg>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Aelik koant, hano benniget,</l>
          <l><lb/>Lawen a vijez, dimezell...</l>
          <l><lb/>An traou-ze holl 'zo tremenet,</l>
          <l><lb/>Vel d'eun deillen gant an Avel!</l>
        </lg>
      </div>
      <div type="article">
        <ab><lb/>Iwan AR BEK.</ab>
      </div>
      <div type="article">
        <ab><lb/>Priz, 14 real; franko, 15 real.</ab>
        <ab type="head"><lb/>EUL LEOR BREZONEK<lb/>great gant daou vicherour :<lb/>Eur Mouller hag eur C'hemener</ab>
        <figure type="decoration"/>
        <p><lb/>Al leor-nevez ema Moullerez Ar Bobl o paouez imprima, 200<lb/>pajen war baper kaër, Kanaouennou Breiz-Vihan, a zo ennan<lb/>38 kanaouen euz ar re vrava, an ton hag ar son, dastumet var<lb/>ar maez duma-duhont gant daou c’hlasker iaouank : Polyt<lb/>Laterre, euz Keraez, ha Fanchik Gourvil, euz Montroulez.</p>
        <p><lb/>O labour a zo humbl ha pozet, evel ar bleun bihan a gresk<lb/>el liorzou, hag a daol eur c’houez ken dilikat.</p>
        <p><lb/>Ar paëroniach o deuz bet a zo gwarant evito. Sethu aze<lb/>Anatol Ar Braz, ar mestr-skrivanier, ha Moris Duhamel, ar<lb/>mestr-musiker.</p>
        <p><lb/>Dalc’het gant hevelep tadou paëron var fonz-badiziant al<lb/>Lizeradur Kanaouennou Breiz-Vihan a vezo digemeret mad<lb/>gant an holl.</p>
        <p rend="heading"><lb/>Moullerez ar Bobl, Stred ar Gar, Keraez.</p>
      </div>
    </body>
